    "colored_noise_fgn_like": "FFT-filtering spectral synthesis: white Gaussian noise scaled per-frequency by f^(-exponent/2), inverse-transformed, z-scored. fGn-like approximation via exponent=2H+1 (spectral relation for fractional Gaussian noise); same technique as mse_multiscale_entropy/visibility_graph validate_synthetic.py, independent implementation.",
